{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reaper Actual is an Open-World Persistent Shooter. Players play as Reapers in a fast-paced FPS mixed with the persistence of an MMORPG. Players come into the world as Reapers. They're given a Base which is their home on the Island of Marova</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras/ddad2134f2338e6e05590c2dea3888e5.avif?t=1751551214\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players\u00a0 use their Base to venture out and do missions for and against the 5 AI Factions that occupy Marova as they level their characters, weapons and the skills of their Reapers (Tier 1 Operators).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras/75882accfea8f24b0c9f5a6fec373b26.avif?t=1751551214\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As they do missions they encounter hundreds of other players because Marova is a completely PVPVE Island where they need to always be looking over their shoulder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras/71a2900af6e3b32963287f9bd0a081fc.avif?t=1751551214\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As they move around in Land, Sea and Air vehicles they end up in the islands 5 different biomes on missions that range from high-stakes HVT missions to collecting resources for the game's deep crafting system. Reaper Actual is bringing it's mix of an Open-World with persistence to players all over the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras/a19e73fb39e4be5404784f1fd183200d.avif?t=1751551214\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2995670?t=1751551214","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/72be059638c669658343fed659e825f8b532be3d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751551214","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/e6159269e89629d80da66a5bd768559edcbb2eae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751551214","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/e6159269e89629d80da66a5bd768559edcbb2eae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751551214","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"HDR available","id":61}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Reaper Actual features realistic looking violence including gunfights, blood, character deaths within a war-torn world. The game features violent crime and war."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reaper Actual is an Open-World Persistent Shooter. Players play as Reapers in a fast-paced FPS mixed with the persistence of an MMORPG. Players come into the world as Reapers. They're given a Base which is their home on the Island of Marova</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras/ddad2134f2338e6e05590c2dea3888e5.avif?t=1751551214\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players\u00a0 use their Base to venture out and do missions for and against the 5 AI Factions that occupy Marova as they level their characters, weapons and the skills of their Reapers (Tier 1 Operators).</p><p clas